      "reason": "A last search date (13.09.2024) is reported for the databases searched."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "We used topic-specific databases PubMed (including MEDLINE; Ovid), PsycINFO (including PsycArticles; EBSCOhost), Psyndex plus (EBSCOhost) and Web of Science (Thomson Reuters, Clarivate Analytics) for adjoining disciplines. ... No publication date limits were applied.",
      "reason": "Database names and platforms/interfaces are reported, and coverage dates are addressed by stating no publication date limits were applied; however, database coverage start dates are not explicitly given."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "In contrast to the previously pre-registered search strategy, the Google Scholar database was excluded due to the large number of records retrieved",
      "reason": "No study registers or online repositories were searched; Google Scholar was explicitly excluded, so this requirement does not apply."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "the Google Scholar database was excluded due to the large number of records retrieved, which exceeded the feasible scope of screening",
      "reason": "No websites or search engines were searched; Google Scholar was excluded, so this requirement does not apply."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "For studies with unavailable full-texts, authors were contacted or articles purchased.",
      "reason": "Authors were contacted only for full-text retrieval, not to identify studies; no organisations or manufacturers were contacted for study identification."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e6",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "For studies with unavailable full-texts, authors were contacted or articles purchased.",
      "reason": "No individuals were contacted to identify studies; author contact was only for obtaining full texts."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e7",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "Additionally, manual reference checks and citation tracking in the Social Science Citation Index were conducted.",
      "reason": "Reference list examination (manual reference checks) is specified."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e8",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "manual reference checks and citation tracking in the Social Science Citation Index were conducted",
      "reason": "The citation index (Social Science Citation Index) is named and the overall search end date (13.09.2024) applies, but seed reports for backward/forward citation searching are not specified."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_6_e9",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "We used topic-specific databases PubMed (including MEDLINE; Ovid), PsycINFO (including PsycArticles; EBSCOhost), Psyndex plus (EBSCOhost) and Web of Science (Thomson Reuters, Clarivate Analytics)",
      "reason": "No journals or conference proceedings were hand-searched as sources; only bibliographic databases, reference checks, and citation tracking were used."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 88
}

